    "Its page’s Play/Pause" : {
      "comment" : "A way to pause and play an app added with Add an App: the Play/Pause button of the page it shows (the Add an App window, Settings → Diagnostics under “Controlled by”)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
