    "Without an option it needs, AutoHush can pause %@ only while its window is in view." : {
      "comment" : "Add an App's Reopen step (as a warning), the alert that asks to reopen the media player, and the help of the menu card's Reopen button; %@ is the app",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "بدون خيار يحتاج إليه، لا يمكن لـ AutoHush إيقاف %@ مؤقتًا إلا عندما تكون نافذته ظاهرة."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sense una opció que necessita, l’AutoHush només pot posar en pausa %@ mentre se’n veu la finestra."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bez volby, kterou potřebuje, může AutoHush aplikaci %@ pozastavit jen tehdy, když je vidět její okno."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uden en indstilling, appen skal bruge, kan AutoHush kun sætte %@ på pause, mens vinduet kan ses."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ohne eine Option, die die App braucht, kann AutoHush %@ nur pausieren, solange das Fenster zu sehen ist."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
